  "outlook": {
    "headline": "Rate expectations at home and abroad, lower crude and foreign buying frame the week",
    "drivers": [
      {
        "title": "Rate expectations in India",
        "text": "Goldman Sachs projects a 25 basis point rise in the RBI's repo rate at the December meeting and a further 50 basis points in the first half of 2027, taking it from 5.50% to 6.25%; SBI Research also expects a 25 basis point rise in December (Business Standard, IANS). Rate expectations reach bond yields, deposit rates and loan rates.",
