        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "Wholesale inflation",
        "text": "Wholesale price inflation rose to 12.29% in October from 11.39% in September, with fuel and power at 32.84%, according to provisional data released on 16 Nov; the government cited mineral oils, crude petroleum, natural gas and electricity (Kotak Neo). Input costs reach company margins and, over time, retail prices.",
