        "text": "Brent settled 1.28% lower at $91.95 on Wednesday after US crude stocks rose 3.4 million barrels in the week to 13 Nov (Reuters, The Nation). Foreign investors bought a net ₹94,229 crore of Indian shares from 1 to 18 November (provisional, Kotak Neo). Oil reaches India through the import bill, the rupee and fuel inflation; flows reach large-cap demand and the currency.",
