      "headline": "The US FDA classified Caplin Steriles' Gummidipoondi plant as Official Action Indicated",
      "what": "Caplin Point Laboratories' unit Caplin Steriles received an Official Action Indicated (OAI) status, the most serious inspection outcome, for its Gummidipoondi facility, following an unannounced inspection from 13 to 21 August that ended with 10 observations; the shares fell on Wednesday (Business Standard, Angel One).",
